        "TileImage": "$($repository 50356ca8-7372-4783-b143-31f2a2cd7c3d).Image",
        "Description": "(Mario Llosa) is a serial killer turned chef and in of all places Mendoza.  He values the INJECTION of special seasonings and ingredients in his meals. His associates make sure that people have a high dose of FIBER in their diets. Our mission is to make sure people stop suffering from this fixed diet plan by any means possible....Good Luck!",
